description	"Ubese Scout

An effective scout, the Ubese seeks out long range engagements from high vantage points. Completely sealed within their environmental gear, they are utterly immune to battlefield hazards.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
- Ubese Neurotoxin Canister (Frag 2)
-- Poisons/Cripples/Force Focuses 
-- Large Splash Radius, 0 Damage

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Knockdown Roll
- Close Combat (3)
- Ubese Environment Protection Suit (Environmental Protection 3)
- Advanced Filters (Immune To Sonic/Poison/Sonic/Locational Damage/Drowning)
- Suit Reliance (5x damage from Ion/Pulse)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Tracking Darts ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4]"